        {
          "text": "Lino kwakasika muntu wa-Leza kwa-Eli, wakamwaambila wati, Mbuboobu mbwaamba Jehova, Teendakalibonya kumeso aaluzubo lwauso nilwakacili mu-Egepita mubuzike bwakwa-Faro? ",
