                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ino nkaambonzi nomulyata cipaizyo cangu acituulo cangu ncindakalaizya muŋanda yangu? Ino nkaambonzi noolemeka bana bako kwiinda ndime nukulinencesya kwanu kuzipaizyo zyoonse ziinda kubota zyabantu bangu ba-Israyeli,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.29",
