                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo kako Jehova Leza wa-Israyeli ulaamba kuti, Ncobeni ndakaamba kuti baluzubo lwako aluzubo lwauso baleenda kubusyu bwangu mazuba oonse, pele sunu Jehova ulaamba kuti, Pe! tacikonzeki! nkaambo abo bandilemeka ambebo ndabalemeka, pele abo bandisampaula balaubulwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.30",
