        {
          "text": "Nkabela nzoobika mupaizi uusyomeka uuyoocita mbuli mbuuyanda moyo wangu amiyeeyo yangu. Oyo njoomuyakila iŋanda iijatide kuti aende kubusyu bwamunanike wangu mazuba oonse. ",
